{
 "lead": 1.0,
 "tail": 8.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "001-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "It's three in the morning.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "001-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 0.8
  },
  {
   "id": "002-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Forty cats are screaming at you from a wall.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "002-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 0.889
  },
  {
   "id": "003-boss",
   "who": "Boss",
   "text": "Last chance, human. Pay the price, or walk away.",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "003-boss.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "004-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "And somewhere in this city, your little sister is lost.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "004-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "005-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "The only ones who saw where she went are cats.",
   "after": 2.5,
   "beat": 1.0,
   "file": "005-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "006-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Two weeks earlier.",
   "after": 2.5,
   "beat": 1.0,
   "file": "006-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "007-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "You wake up.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "007-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "008-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Your cat, Pickles, is sitting on your chest.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "008-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "009-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Fourteen years old.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "009-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 0.667
  },
  {
   "id": "010-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Orange.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "010-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "011-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Shaped like a loaf of bread.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "011-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "012-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "He stares at you and says:",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "012-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "013-pickles",
   "who": "Pickles",
   "text": "Breakfast. Now. You useless, hairless giant.",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "013-pickles.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "014-you",
   "who": "You",
   "text": "Did you just... talk?",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "014-you.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "015-pickles",
   "who": "Pickles",
   "text": "Did you just... understand me?",
   "after": 2.05,
   "beat": 1.0,
   "file": "015-pickles.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "016-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "He doesn't know.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "016-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "017-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Nobody knows.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "017-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "018-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Overnight, every meow, every hiss, every purr in the world has become words.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "018-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "019-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Only for you.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "019-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "020-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "So, what if you could understand every cat?",
   "after": 3.5,
   "beat": 2.0,
   "file": "020-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "021-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Here's the strange part.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "021-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "022-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Grown cats barely meow at each other.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "022-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "023-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Scientists think the meow is mostly for us.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "023-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "024-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Cats have been talking to humans for thousands of years.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "024-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "025-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "We just never understood a word.",
   "after": 2.5,
   "beat": 1.0,
   "file": "025-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "026-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Plus.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "026-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "027-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "You finally know what they're saying.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "027-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "028-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "The cat at the bus stop.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "028-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "029-duchess",
   "who": "Duchess",
   "text": "Darling, your shoe is untied. And your haircut is a tragedy.",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "029-duchess.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "030-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "The kitten in the pet shop window.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "030-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "031-noodle",
   "who": "Noodle",
   "text": "Pick me! Pick me! I bite, but only a little!",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "031-noodle.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "032-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Mrs. Gomez next door has six cats.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "032-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "033-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "They tell you everything.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "033-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "034-duchess",
   "who": "Duchess",
   "text": "She talks to her plants. She lost her ring in the sofa in March. It's still there.",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "034-duchess.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "035-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "You find the ring.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "035-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "036-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Mrs. Gomez cries.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "036-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "037-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "She gives you a whole lemon cake.",
   "after": 2.5,
   "beat": 1.0,
   "file": "037-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "038-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "A cat can hear sounds up to eighty-five thousand hertz.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "038-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 0.7
  },
  {
   "id": "039-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Four times higher than you.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "039-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "040-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "So cats hear everything.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "040-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "041-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Leaking pipes.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "041-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "042-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Mice in the walls.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "042-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "043-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Secrets behind closed doors.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "043-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "044-pickles",
   "who": "Pickles",
   "text": "The man in 4B snores in two different keys.",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "044-pickles.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "045-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "And cats watch everything.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "045-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "046-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "From windows, from walls, from cars.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "046-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "047-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Every street has eyes.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "047-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "048-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "You start helping people.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "048-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "049-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "A lost wallet.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "049-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "050-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "A missing dog.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "050-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "051-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "A gas leak in the basement, which three cats smelled before anyone else.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "051-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "052-newsanchor",
   "who": "News Anchor",
   "text": "A local teenager, the so-called \"Cat Whisperer\", has found eleven lost pets this week.",
   "after": 2.05,
   "beat": 1.0,
   "file": "052-newsanchor.wav",
   "take_score": 0.933
  },
  {
   "id": "053-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Minus.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "053-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "054-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Cats are brutally honest.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "054-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "055-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "You hug Pickles.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "055-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "056-pickles",
   "who": "Pickles",
   "text": "Your heart is beating like a scared mouse. Put me down.",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "056-pickles.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "057-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "You sing in the shower.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "057-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "058-pickles",
   "who": "Pickles",
   "text": "I have heard birds die more quietly.",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "058-pickles.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "059-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "And you finally learn why he sleeps on you every night.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "059-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "060-pickles",
   "who": "Pickles",
   "text": "You're warm. That's it. Don't flatter yourself.",
   "after": 2.05,
   "beat": 1.0,
   "file": "060-pickles.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "061-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Cats are most awake at dawn and dusk.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "061-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "062-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "And at night, they gossip.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "062-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "063-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Every alley, every roof.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "063-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "064-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "You can't turn it off.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "064-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "065-noodle",
   "who": "Noodle",
   "text": "Is that a moth? It's a moth! Everyone, it's a moth!",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "065-noodle.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "066-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "You sleep three hours a night.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "066-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "067-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "You laugh at nothing in class.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "067-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "068-teacher",
   "who": "Teacher",
   "text": "Something funny, Kai?",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "068-teacher.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "069-you",
   "who": "You",
   "text": "No. Sorry. A cat outside just insulted a pigeon.",
   "after": 2.05,
   "beat": 1.0,
   "file": "069-you.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "070-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "And if you've ever wondered what your cat really thinks of you, subscribe.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "070-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "071-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Pickles says you won't.",
   "after": 2.5,
   "beat": 1.0,
   "file": "071-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 0.75
  },
  {
   "id": "072-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Then there's Lily.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "072-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "073-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Your sister.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "073-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "074-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Seven.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "074-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "075-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "She loves Pickles more than anything.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "075-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "076-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Pickles pretends to hate her.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "076-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "077-lily",
   "who": "Lily",
   "text": "Pickles! Pickles, come here, I made you a hat!",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "077-lily.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "078-pickles",
   "who": "Pickles",
   "text": "Absolutely not.",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "078-pickles.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "079-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "But every night, he sleeps outside her door.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "079-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "080-you",
   "who": "You",
   "text": "You like her.",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "080-you.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "081-pickles",
   "who": "Pickles",
   "text": "I watch the small ones. Somebody has to.",
   "after": 3.05,
   "beat": 2.0,
   "file": "081-pickles.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "082-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Saturday.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "082-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "083-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "The street fair.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "083-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "084-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Music.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "084-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "085-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Crowds.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "085-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "086-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Lily holds your hand, then a balloon, then nothing.",
   "after": 2.5,
   "beat": 1.0,
   "file": "086-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 0.889
  },
  {
   "id": "087-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "She's gone.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "087-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "088-mom",
   "who": "Mom",
   "text": "Lily? Lily!",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "088-mom.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "089-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Police.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "089-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "090-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Phones.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "090-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "091-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Flyers.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "091-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "092-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Eight o'clock.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "092-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "093-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Ten.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "093-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 0.0
  },
  {
   "id": "094-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Midnight.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "094-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "095-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Nothing.",
   "after": 3.5,
   "beat": 2.0,
   "file": "095-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "096-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "But the cats saw.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "096-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "097-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Cats always see.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "097-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "098-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "You go to the old garage behind the market, where the street cats rule.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "098-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "099-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Their leader is a giant one-eyed tomcat.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "099-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "100-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "They call him Boss.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "100-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "101-boss",
   "who": "Boss",
   "text": "A human who understands us. Funny. Why would we help you?",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "101-boss.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "102-you",
   "who": "You",
   "text": "Because she's seven.",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "102-you.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "103-boss",
   "who": "Boss",
   "text": "Kittens get lost every day. Nobody looks for ours.",
   "after": 2.05,
   "beat": 1.0,
   "file": "103-boss.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "104-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Every winter, thousands of street cats die from cold and hunger.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "104-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "105-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Nobody counts them.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "105-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "106-boss",
   "who": "Boss",
   "text": "Here's the price. You feed the alley. Every day. Every cat. Forever. And you tell the humans what we need.",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "106-boss.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "107-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Forever is a long time.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "107-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "108-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "But Lily has one night.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "108-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "109-you",
   "who": "You",
   "text": "Deal.",
   "after": 2.05,
   "beat": 1.0,
   "file": "109-you.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "110-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Boss jumps on the wall and yowls.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "110-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "111-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "The sound goes from roof to roof, street to street, across the whole city.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "111-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "112-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Forty cats.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "112-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "113-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Then a hundred.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "113-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "114-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Then hundreds.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "114-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "115-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "A message passing faster than any phone.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "115-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "116-duchess",
   "who": "Duchess",
   "text": "Small human, yellow coat, red balloon?",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "116-duchess.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "117-noodle",
   "who": "Noodle",
   "text": "I saw a balloon! It was red! Or a tomato!",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "117-noodle.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "118-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Nobody saw her after the fair.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "118-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "119-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "The trail goes cold.",
   "after": 3.5,
   "beat": 2.0,
   "file": "119-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "120-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "And then, one voice.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "120-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "121-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Old.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "121-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "122-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Tired.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "122-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "123-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Grumpy.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "123-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "124-pickles",
   "who": "Pickles",
   "text": "Took you long enough.",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "124-pickles.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "125-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Pickles.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "125-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "126-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "On the rooftop.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "126-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "127-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Fourteen years old, and he has followed her since the fair.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "127-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 0.909
  },
  {
   "id": "128-pickles",
   "who": "Pickles",
   "text": "She chased a kitten into the old train yard. She's in a broken train car. She's cold. She's scared. And she won't stop talking to me about hats.",
   "after": 2.05,
   "beat": 1.0,
   "file": "128-pickles.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "129-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "You run.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "129-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "130-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Mom runs.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "130-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "131-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "The police run.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "131-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "132-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Pickles leads the way, roof by roof.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "132-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "133-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Train car number nine.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "133-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "134-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "A small yellow coat.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "134-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "135-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "A red balloon tied to the door.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "135-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "136-lily",
   "who": "Lily",
   "text": "Kai! Pickles stayed with me the whole time!",
   "after": 3.05,
   "beat": 2.0,
   "file": "136-lily.wav",
   "take_score": 0.875
  },
  {
   "id": "137-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Mom holds Lily.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "137-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "138-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "You hold Pickles.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "138-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "139-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "And this time, he doesn't tell you to put him down.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "139-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "140-you",
   "who": "You",
   "text": "Why did you follow her?",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "140-you.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "141-pickles",
   "who": "Pickles",
   "text": "I told you. I watch the small ones.",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "141-pickles.wav",
   "take_score": 0.875
  },
  {
   "id": "142-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Then he looks at you.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "142-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "143-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "And blinks.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "143-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "144-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Slowly.",
   "after": 3.5,
   "beat": 2.0,
   "file": "144-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "145-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Scientists at the University of Sussex found that a slow blink is how cats smile.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "145-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "146-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Blink slowly back, and they understand.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "146-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "147-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "You blink back.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "147-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "148-pickles",
   "who": "Pickles",
   "text": "Fine. I like you. Don't make it weird.",
   "after": 2.05,
   "beat": 1.0,
   "file": "148-pickles.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "149-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "The next morning, you keep your promise.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "149-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "150-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Bowls on every corner.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "150-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "151-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "The city listens to the boy who speaks cat.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "151-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "152-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "A shelter opens behind the market.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "152-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "153-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Its sign says: \"Boss's House.\"",
   "after": 2.5,
   "beat": 1.0,
   "file": "153-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "154-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "That night, there's a knock at the window.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "154-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "155-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "A cat you've never seen.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "155-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "156-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Black.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "156-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "157-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Green eyes.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "157-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "158-shadowcat",
   "who": "Shadow Cat",
   "text": "So you're the human who understands us. Good. We've been waiting a very long time. Something is coming, and the cats are not the only ones who know.",
   "after": 0.55,
   "file": "158-shadowcat.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "159-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Behind him, a dog barks.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "159-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "160-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "And for the first time in your life, you understand that too.",
   "after": 3.5,
   "beat": 2.0,
   "file": "160-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "161-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "So, would you want to understand every cat, if it meant hearing what they really think of you?",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "161-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "162-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "Tell us in the comments.",
   "after": 0.6,
   "file": "162-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "163-narrator",
   "who": "Narrator",
   "text": "And if Pickles made you cry a little, hit like and subscribe for part two.",
   "after": 1.0,
   "file": "163-narrator.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  }
 ]
}